# Exception: the tray binary embedded into beacon-agent.exe via //go:embed
# (agent/internal/service/tray_windows.go) -- must be a real, checked-in
# file or a fresh clone can't build ./cmd/agent at all. Refreshed by
# scripts/publish-agent.mjs's pre-build step before an actual release, but
# needs to exist and work correctly for local dev in the meantime.
!agent/internal/service/embedded/beacon-tray.exe
